Protocol: DH ratchet

State:
RK <- new

Knowledge:
A : A,B,RK,kdf_RKr,kdf_RKl,g,h
B : A,B,RK,kdf_RKr,kdf_RKl,g,h

Actions:

Repeat 2:
A: new X
A -> B : A,B,exp(g,X)
B: new Y
B -> A : A,B,exp(g,Y)



Let:
DH  = exp(exp(g,X),Y)
CK  = kdf_RKr(RK,DH)
RK' = kdf_RKl(RK,DH)

A -> B : {| format(MsgA1) |}_CK
B -> A: {| ack(h(MsgA1))|}_CK



New State:
RK = RK'

EndRepeat

Goals:
MsgA1 secret between A,B;
MsgA2 secret between A,B;
B weakly authenticates A on MsgA1;
B weakly authenticates A on MsgA2;
